179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (With the rapid growth of digital documents across education, government, and enterprise systems, there has been a major shift from traditional paper-based records to digitally issued certificates. This transformation has increased the demand for fast, reliable, and remote document verification. As digital governance and e-services continue to expand, trust and authenticity have become critical factors. At the same time, the widespread use of online document sharing has also increased the risk of document forgery and unauthorized manipulation)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
