<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (Rising cases of document forgery and unauthorized tampering pose serious challenges to digital systems. Centralized storage creates single points of failure, while manual verification is slow and error-prone. Advanced AI-generated forgeries are difficult to detect, and sensitive user data is often exposed. These issues highlight the need for transparent, tamper-proof, and trustless verification mechanisms.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
